        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9151, Solid Brass Sky Tower Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUndeniably alluring in design, the Sky Tower Cabinet Knob will add a modern accent to any cabinet door. It is available in many finishes all of which grant very contemporary looks. The Omnia 9151 Solid Brass Sky Tower Cabinet Knob is available in 1 inch diameter, 1-3/16 inch diameter, and 1-1/2 inch diameter sizes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Sky Tower Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9151/25</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9151/30</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9151/38</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
